Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:22.96,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Can you see this, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.67,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,We finally get to sing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:33.92,Flashback Dialogue,SMom,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura, music has the power\Nto make people happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.06,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:44.10,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,The power to make people happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.90,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what Hayato-kun is doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:27.50,Episode Title,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,500)}{\c&H0303C1&}Imitation {\c&HFFFFFF&}Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:25.49,Main Dialogue Top,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning. Kisaragi Hayato reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:28.25,Main Dialogue Top,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You said you had something to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:31.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.93,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0050,,You don't understand, Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0050,,This is my summer house. \NIt's for rest and relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.01,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0050,,It makes complete sense \NI'd be in a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:42.38,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Is it possible that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:46.56,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,seeing me in my swimsuit is exciting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:49.83,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.96,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Not used to dealing with women, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:56.57,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Before we talk, how about I give you \Na good look at me in my bikini
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:58.97,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,and make you blush even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.34,Main Dialogue Top,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,P-President!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:00.03,Main Dialogue Top,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Don't, Claire-sama! I untied...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:03.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.32,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.41,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:09.54,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,You saw, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.09,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.42,Main Dialogue Top,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want your excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.96,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to knock those memories of \NClaire-sama's boobs out of your head—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.30,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:22.28,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Damn that K-Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:23.93,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Liddy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.18,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato is right under—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:29.65,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Under?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.11,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:44.49,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyway, let's get to the matter at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:50.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We received a report from HQ yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:52.75,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It said that during the \NSavage attack last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:58.71,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,a variable stone was stolen from\N the concert venue amid all that chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.46,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A variable stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:06.00,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Kirishima Sakura was planning on \Nusing it during her performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:09.14,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,And they only reported it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:15.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I keep telling HQ to share all of their intel\Nwith {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0} but they never listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:20.65,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,A variable stone is an incredibly rare ore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:25.75,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,There's no guarantee that the thieves\N won't come back looking for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:29.41,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know who could be hiding where.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:33.60,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato, make sure you \Nkeep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.21,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're counting on you to \Nguard Kirishima Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:38.59,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:41.92,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I will make sure my mission \Nthis afternoon is a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:43.57,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:49.18,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Now, on to private business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:53.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I want a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're having a swimming contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:04:59.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.90,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:04.74,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I've had a swimsuit prepared \Nfor you, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:12.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A... speedo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is going to be fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.75,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:30.42,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,He's no fun, that Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:40.57,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Hi there, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:43.83,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.65,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:50.50,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,We don't get to go out very often,\Nso let me be a normal girl on this date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:54.27,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But what if any of our \Nfellow students see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.73,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:06:00.06,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,We're pretty far from where \Nthe {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} is harbored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:02.97,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.99,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.18,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:10.93,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I think it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.78,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.93,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.69,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Now, it's time for you to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.20,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go. I've already picked out a store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.23,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:25.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emil...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.52,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia. Is this fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.29,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Yeah, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.75,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:35.16,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,You look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:36.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.93,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What were you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:43.31,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking of getting\Nan accessory or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.75,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Plus it'd make for a good \Nmemento of our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.33,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I think this'd work best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:50.32,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,But I like this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,How about we get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,On me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.87,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:56.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.07,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:01.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:02.41,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:05.40,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,This makes me yours, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:06.40,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:10.58,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,When a guy gives a girl a pendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.91,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,it's a way of saying that\N she is his, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:16.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.54,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I'll treasure this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyway, how about we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:28.96,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:30.16,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:35.73,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,So Fritz, when did you get \Nyour driver's license?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:37.85,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,When you weren't paying attention, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.11,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Stop treating me like a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.16,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Your head's always at\Nthe most convenient height.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.61,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:45.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:49.16,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe we came to the same store.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:53.40,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, Fritz was the one who \Ntold me about this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.47,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:58.41,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think we'd run into him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:02.47,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know any other stores,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:06.42,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,and I wanted to at least go \Non a girl-date with you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.62,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyway, we're going to \Nfind an opening and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be all sorts of trouble if they see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.94,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:16.06,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't mind staying like this \Na little longer, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.11,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That was a close shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.01,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:26.03,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get us something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.71,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nah, that's the guy's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:32.22,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,An emergency call?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.68,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.08,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.26,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me, Savage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:48.00,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.56,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kirishima Sakura has disappeared\Nfrom her hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:56.03,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Though it seems that she wasn't kidnapped,\Nbut rather left of her own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:09:00.22,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like she turned off\Nthe GPS on her PDA, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But where would she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That's what we're trying to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:09.09,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Depending on how it goes,\Nwe may have you join the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:13.63,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I'd rather have you \Njoin in now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:17.20,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President... Is it just me,\Nor do you sound angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.23,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying, Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:28.17,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I be angry that you went shopping\Nwith Emile Crossfode while I'm working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.76,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.70,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You coldly turned down\Nmy challenge this morning, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:40.79,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of apologizing, make it up to me\Nby going shopping with {\i1}me{\i0} next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.77,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:52.08,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyway, contact me if you learn anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:57.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where Sakura went...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.72,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:09:59.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.91,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:06.22,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.57,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:10.00,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:13.32,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That looks pretty good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.01,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.09,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,How did you know where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:21.39,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:23.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Just in case something happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:27.52,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,a client can track their \Nbodyguard through GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.79,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Come. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:32.97,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,There's a place I want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:33.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.07,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Secret spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.06,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But I guarantee it's a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.21,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:43.45,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:44.93,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.85,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You have something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:48.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.64,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,If she runs into Emilia,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:53.13,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,things are going to get ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:59.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But in exchange, I want you \Nto contact Souffle-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:00.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's my condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.82,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's go, Mr. Hero \Nof these Zwei Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.93,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Could you get us a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.46,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:15.76,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Emilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.50,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll contact you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.45,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:21.78,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:23.95,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:26.63,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,A text?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.21,0:11:28.96,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:32.08,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.56,Main Dialogue Top,Sakura(BG),0000,0000,0000,,Yes. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:39.84,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I texted Emilia about what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.68,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm sure she's gonna be mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:44.72,Main Dialogue Top,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I'm sorry I left \Nwithout saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.22,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:50.82,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I've more or less finished the song\Nthat's going on the album, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:51.89,Italics Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Don't worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:53.25,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, you explain the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:54.23,Italics Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Hello, Sakura? Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:54.23,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:57.83,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Souffle-san. \NIt's Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.36,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,We're the ones who should\N be sorry, Kisaragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:03.11,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,You're having to deal with\NSakura's whims and fancies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.34,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:07.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:09.70,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.58,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll contact you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.93,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:21.79,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,She wants us back by \Nrehearsal, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.59,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:27.89,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it's fine. \NNow no one is going to bug us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:32.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You think you can tell me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:36.73,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I told you it was secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.49,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Did we find Kirishima Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:48.74,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:53.79,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato just informed us\Nthat she's with him currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.98,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,According to her PDA's location info,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:59.91,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,they're heading towards \Nthe island's Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:01.42,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:03.66,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What a boob.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:15.57,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Hayato-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.39,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it an amazing view?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:21.73,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.32,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's the Zwei Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.99,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I really wanted to show you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.16,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:37.29,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You're the hero who protected this vista...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:42.11,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,This precious place my mom showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.26,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.93,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,When I met you yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:56.43,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,all I could think of was how you protected this place\Nand preserved my memories with mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.93,0:13:58.58,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,...and I got kind of excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.40,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I was acting pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:13.69,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, I want to thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:18.97,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for saving \Nsomething so special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:23.43,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop it. I just fought without \Nreally thinking about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:26.05,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't have won without\Nthe help of the other Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:29.35,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a hero to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:31.30,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,So let me thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:33.81,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.58,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good song.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.49,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,My little sister used to hum that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:57.77,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.91,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My mom created that song for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.85,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I've rarely ever let anyone hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.56,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Even now, I only hummed it because\NI wanted you to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:21.73,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, could you\Ntell me your sister's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's Karen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:32.32,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Were you in Gudenberg during\N the second Savage attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:32.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:34.97,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,In the shelter downtown?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:39.62,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Could you be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:47.67,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, when I'd lost my mother and was all alone,\Nthis sibling pair told me they liked my singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:49.88,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,The sister's name was Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:53.05,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't get to hear the brother's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:58.70,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,So it was you, Hayato-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:07.12,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I sang the song my mom composed for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.71,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And in the end, the brother said to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:15.57,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know much about music,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.47,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,but your singing makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:22.52,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.67,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that boy—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:27.36,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,the one who changed my entire life—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.03,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,was you, Hayato-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:31.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.18,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:38.89,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,When you praised me back then,\NI started to like singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:40.49,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It filled me with confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:44.10,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And that's what made me\Nwant to become a singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:48.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought we'd meet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:51.24,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy I kept singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:57.65,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But we only met that one time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:00.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You were gone the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:04.37,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. My father, who I had never \Nmet before, came to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.03,0:17:07.33,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Shortly after I was taken back to\N my father's homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:10.50,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I became ill with an unknown virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.63,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The same as Karen...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:19.35,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Souffle was a genetic engineer\Nwho was in charge of me at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.94,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't get better at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:28.17,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Instead, I lost my voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:30.27,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,and wasn't able to sing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:36.40,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My father, without asking Souffle at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:40.28,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,sold me off to a Warslarn research facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:46.99,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,There we were injected with a vaccine \Nmade from Savage fluids,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:52.19,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,under orders from the director\N of the lab, Vitaly Tynyanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:58.63,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Several children died because\N the vaccine was so potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:04.16,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But I survived and came to\Nbe able to sing once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.27,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I was saved by Vitaly's vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:15.44,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,However, the vaccine continued to be\Ninjected into the children that survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.57,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.53,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly's goal isn't to cure illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:25.08,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It was to artificially turn \Nnormal humans into Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:29.24,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Even when we were able to deploy a Hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:33.19,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,they continued to inject the vaccine, \Nattempting to give us even stronger powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:37.09,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what the side effects,\N they kept doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:48.32,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Latuni!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:52.72,Flashback Dialogue,Latuni,0000,0000,0000,,Sing, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.57,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.33,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And I sang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.92,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Because everyone calmed down when I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.77,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And I sang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.35,0:19:13.71,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,So they could feel a little bit more at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.14,0:19:17.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:22.35,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But not one of them\N made a complete recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:26.39,Flashback Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.43,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,By luck, I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:36.23,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My illness was cured, \Nand while I can't fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:37.86,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I am now a Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:42.81,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I can even sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:45.95,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,and be Kirishima Sakura, the diva.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:49.23,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.92,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So you're a Variant, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:56.13,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, why do you know about Variants?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:56.79,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.65,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And you said "too." \NWhat do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:01.84,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm a Variant, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:11.27,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:12.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:16.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I only became one by accident, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:19.78,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I only recently learned about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.27,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:27.13,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You're the same as me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:29.70,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:31.59,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:32.21,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.99,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:38.88,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You're the person who changed my life,\Nthe hero who preserved my memories here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:42.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,and a Variant who shares the same fate as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:46.47,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,And we just happened to meet again \Nand spend time together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.35,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,This has to be a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.18,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:53.37,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought of a bunch of songs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.06,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I can't sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:59.83,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go the concert hall and work\Non writing songs between rehearsals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:02.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sakura, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.47,0:21:06.27,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.56,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:18.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's good they had a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:22.88,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think there \Nwouldn't be any taxis around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.56,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,There weren't many tourists there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:26.73,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:29.08,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's a special place for my mom and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:31.68,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't want a lot of people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:32.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:42.40,Flashback Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.50,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.15,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:53.31,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:56.04,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:57.44,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:02.28,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A Savage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:03.92,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.97,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.68,0:22:14.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:16.17,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:05.74,Next Episode Title,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1)}{\c&H0303C1&}The Diva's {\c&HFFFFFF&} Love Song
